# --- Artifacts the test suite writes into the working tree (TD-PC-12) --------
# The suite writes ~43 files to fixed relative paths instead of tmp_path. This
# is an interim guard, NOT the fix: the tests should use tmp_path, which would
# also unblock `pytest -n auto`.
#
# The entry that matters most is pamola_core/utils/resources/: a test downloads
# the fastText language-identification model (lid.176.bin, 125 MB) *into the
# package tree*. It reached a commit once and GitHub rejected the push for
# exceeding the 100 MB blob limit. A test writing into the code tree can also
# mask a packaging bug - a resource the wheel fails to ship still resolves
# locally from whatever a previous run left behind.
pamola_core/utils/resources/
/config.json
/my_task/
/output/
/pamola_datasets/
/task/
/temp_task_dir/
/test_task_dir/
/test_tmp_dir/
/test_vis_dir/
configs/execution_log.json
configs/test_task_*.json
/cov_full.txt
/cov_now.json